        "body_en": "Coordinated digital attacks occur when multiple accounts simultaneously target an individual with hostile comments, false reporting, or doxxing. The volume of notifications can feel overwhelming. Protecting mental wellbeing during an online incident is a priority: temporary deactivation, muting notifications, and handing account oversight to a trusted ally helps reduce immediate psychological strain.",
