        "body_en": "Misinformation is false or inaccurate information shared without harmful intent (e.g., someone genuinely believing an outdated health tip). Disinformation is intentionally fabricated or misleading information created with malicious intent to deceive, profit, or cause reputational harm. Recognizing this distinction helps determine whether education or formal moderation is needed.",
